<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the Swiss Indoor tennis championships on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat 2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman beat 7-Mark Philppoussis (Australia) 6-1 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France) beat 5-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-1 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 7-6 (7-2) 7-5.  </p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany) 5-7 6-3 7-5 3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 6-3 6-7 (6-8) 6-3 Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-7 (4-7) 6-3 6-2  </p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat 8-Michael Stich (Germany) 6-7</p>
<p>(4-7) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
